  "notes": "The ministry's page on the general education system (Internet Archive copy, 2021; the current moe.edu.ps page loads empty) lists grades الأول to العاشر الأساسي and الحادي عشر (1ث) and الثاني عشر (2ث), which end in the Tawjihi exam. Pupils enter grade 1 at 5 years 6 months, so most start in the year they turn 6. Secondary has academic (scientific, humanities) and vocational streams."
